<title>USA: USDA weekly export sales report due out Friday.</title>
<headline>USDA weekly export sales report due out Friday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Department of Agriculture said its weekly export sales report will be released on Friday at 0830EST/1330 GMT and that next week's report will be similiarly delayed.</p>
<p>USDA normally issues the report on U.S. export sales of grains, oilseeds and products on Thursdays at 0830/1330. The department said release would be delayed by a day this week and next week due to the Christmas and New Year's holidays.</p>
</text>
